{
  "note": "Expected resolved TV tokens. Asserted by packages/designs (Vitest), apps/tv/tvos (XCTest) and later apps/tv/android-tv (JUnit). A hex or font token is the preset string VERBATIM: no renderer changes its case and no renderer adds or removes the '#'. The 'uppercase-hex' case pins that. A renderer suite must fail on a case name or a token key it does not know. In a token path a braced segment is indirect: a bare word is a semantic name, replaced by the palette key semanticToKey maps it to; a dotted inner path is read from the preset root. A path that reaches no string resolves to null. The hope-tv preset is referenced, never copied (ADR-0164 point 3): '$ref' is '<file>#/<json-pointer>' relative to fixtures/app-contract/ and is the only reference form.",
